  "changes": [
    {
      "id": "weekly-upstream-20261101",
      "notes": "Align existing native MRTR implementation with published 10 continuation retries and 250ms state-only pacing; remove unpublished 16-input/256KiB-state limits. Retry tools/call, resources/read and prompts/get from original params with fresh IDs and only current-round answers/state; preserve empty state string. Cancellation, close, per-round and total deadlines cover non-cooperative handler waits and prevent late resends; zero timeout prevents first request; processing error retains cause. Modern discovery unsupported-version diagnostic preserves fields and cause without silent downgrade. Stable listPrompts/getPrompt and deprecated experimental forwarding aliases. Reviewed upstream: @ai-sdk/mcp 2.0.84 to 2.0.88. Validation passed: node Scripts/test-packages.mjs (all 52 owning package suites and the compatibility facade); node Scripts/sdk.mjs generate --check; node --test Scripts/tests/*.test.cjs (27 passed); docs-site check and build (100 pages). Live provider calls were not run.",
      "compatibility": "Minor release for stable prompt APIs and preserved MCP error causes; deprecated aliases still forward. Core minimum remains 1.0.0. Input-required URL elicitation and sampling remain unsupported, as upstream specifies. Offline fixtures do not prove live service behavior."
    }
  ],
